<title>NEW ZEALAND: Owens sees yr net profit close to 1995/96.</title>
<headline>Owens sees yr net profit close to 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Owens Group Ltd on Wednesday said that subject to there being no prolonged industrial stoppages in Australia, it anticipated its annual result for the 1996/97 year to approximate last year's NZ$9.1 million result.</p>
</text>
